 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nWestbrook Pharma Ltd                                           MASTER SERVICES\n14 King Street, LS1 4DY Leeds, United Kingdom                 AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB180924947\n\nFROM                                                         BILL TO\n\nWestbrook Pharma Ltd                                         Albion Components Ltd\n14 King Street                                               14 King Street\nLS1 4DY Leeds                                                LS1 4DY Leeds\nUnited Kingdom                                               United Kingdom\nVAT: GB180924947\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 27/05/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Westbrook\nPharma Ltd, with its registered office at 14 King Street, Leeds (\"Party A\"), and Albion Components Ltd, with its registered office at 14 King\nStreet, Leeds (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Westbrook Pharma Ltd / Oliver Bennett\nParty B      Albion Components Ltd / Oliver Bennett\nDate         27/05/2026",
